*
!.env.development
!.env.production
!.eslintrc.json
!.npmrc
!.prettierrc
!excalidraw-app/
!lawha-server/
!package.json
!public/
!packages/
!scripts/
!tsconfig.json
!yarn.lock

# keep (sub)sub directories at the end to exclude from explicit included
# e.g. ./packages/excalidraw/{dist,node_modules}
**/build
**/dist
**/node_modules

# The live database, its WAL, and every uploaded blob — several megabytes of
# real user data. This exclusion has to live here, in the ROOT ignore file:
# BuildKit reads the .dockerignore beside the build context and never a nested
# one, so a lawha-server/.dockerignore would be silently ignored.
lawha-server/lawha-data

# Self-signed TLS material. nginx gets it through a read-only bind mount at
# runtime (see docker-compose.yml); a private key must never enter an image.
certs
